* [https://basilisk.fr/sandbox/M1EMN/PYTHON/shdb.py]() Savage Hutter depth averaged collapse of a heap (same than [https://basilisk.fr/sandbox/M1EMN/Exemples/savagestaron.c]())

* [https://basilisk.fr/sandbox/M1EMN/PYTHON/svvisc.py]() Huppert viscous collapse of a heap 
